GIT STATUS
==========

Show what changed in your repository.


BASIC
-----
git status

Shows:
• Modified files
• New files
• Deleted files
• Current branch


SHORT VERSION
-------------
git status -s

Compact view with symbols:
  M  = Modified
  A  = Added
  D  = Deleted
  ?? = Untracked


WHAT IT TELLS YOU
-----------------
• Files ready to commit (green)
• Files not staged yet (red)
• Untracked files
• Your branch status


ERRORS
------
"not a git repository"  → Run git init first
